Scope: the above covers this repository's own original work -- the build
scripts (`build-renku-arm64-iso.sh`, `run-renku-arm64.sh`), the patches in
`arm64-patch/patches/`, and the documentation.

This repository builds and patches RenkuOS (https://github.com/RenkuOS/Source),
which is not included here and is not covered by the license above. RenkuOS
follows its own license -- see
https://github.com/RenkuOS/Source/blob/main/License.md -- which, like
upstream Haiku, is mostly MIT with some files under other licenses.

`arm64-patch/packages/` contains prebuilt binary packages built from their
own upstream projects (curl, wget, zstd, OpenSSL, HaikuWebKit, and others).
Each follows that project's own license, not this one. The R* apps
installed via `pkgman` from https://pkgman.rainygirl.com/arm64 are not part
of this repository at all.
